  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to WFP for urgent food needs of conflict affected households in NE Nigeria  &#x2013; WFP Country Strategic Plan - Outcome 1</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FCDO funds WFP to provide food assistance to food-insecure internally displaced persons, refugees, returnees and host communities in crisis-prone and conflict-affected areas of North East Nigeria to meet their immediate food and nutrition needs during and after shocks. FCDO funds:
a) Emergency food assistance: In-kind food distributions and Cash-based transfers (cash or e-vouchers) where markets function
b) Lean-season scale-up: Support to reach extremely food-insecure populations during the annual hunger peak.
c) Early recovery elements: Supporting transition from food relief to resilience where feasible.</narrative>
  </description>
